   "notes": "Complete equations (6)-(14) Pt pressure scale. The published molar V0=9.091 cm^3/mol is converted to the four-atom fcc conventional cell using the exact Avogadro constant. The implementation includes the two generalized-Bose and two Einstein oscillator terms, volume-dependent Gruneisen law, intrinsic anharmonicity, electronic excitation, and vacancy contribution, all referenced to 298.15 K.",
